{"id":"n37251-1-7","stage":3,"title":"착각 · 错觉","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37251-1-7-1","ko":"지수는 자기가 굉장히 예쁜 줄 아는 것 같아.","zh":"智秀好像觉得自己特别漂亮。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"자기가","meaning":"自己","explanation":"자기：自己；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자기","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57311","senseId":"1","lemma":"자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"굉장히","meaning":"非常，惊人地","explanation":"굉장히：非常，惊人地","readings":[{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30882","senseId":"2","lemma":"굉장히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁜","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아는","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"